Navigation systems for vehicles are increasingly used globally, to meet this demand there are many applications in the market. However, there are some of these applications such as TomTom that enjoy high endorsement and have the credibility of many users.
In its beginnings in the early 90s, it was dedicated to the creation of handheld computers, shortly after they made a change of course. At the beginning of this century, it began to specialize in navigation systems and began to develop exclusive hardware for this purpose.
Today TomTom is consolidated among the leading companies in location technology. Guaranteeing you high precision maps, navigation software and real-time traffic information and services.
It is worth noting that, to perform some of the TomTom updates, you must make a payment, however, certain conditions allow you to update your device for free. These conditions include that your device has the "Lifetime Maps Guarantee" or that you have recently purchased your device.
TomTom navigators have software that allows you to transfer important information to your device and to perform a map update. These programs also allow you to update and renew internal software, as well as manage your browser services.
If you have a TomTom PRO navigator you must install the application MyDriveConnect so you can better enjoy your driving experience. Keep the most recent version of this application, once installed you just have to connect your TomTom navigator to the computer and the application will start automatically.
This is the procedure to follow to perform the update:
With the help of a USB cable connect your browser to the computer, MyDrive Connect will start automatically. Next, a screen will open where you must log in to enter the application.
When entering the application select the option "Tools", then you must click on "Use the latest map guarantee".
Click on "Continue", in this way the download and installation of the new map will begin, once the process is finished click on "Done".
Other ways to get TomTom for free
A widely used way to update TomTom through these means is by accessing the forum at Forokeys.com. In Forokeys you will not only find maps, you will also find other tools that you can download to your browser.
Downloading maps in ForoKeys is very similar to what is done in other sites where you do unofficial downloads. In the forum you will find the links to the TomTom maps, select them and you will be redirected to the map download website.
Although there are currently many navigation software that you can use from your phone, there are many advantages to using TomTom devices. It is true that an investment is required for your purchase, however, carrying out the cost-benefit evaluation will allow you to make the most convenient decision.
To keep it current, the company frequently updates its maps. The materialization of these changes is carried out promptly thanks to the work of the Atlas division which is in charge of its production.
There are many navigation software, however TomTom continues to be one of the most efficient, reliable and versatile on the market. For that reason we want to show you its usefulness, if this content has been useful to you, do not stop sharing it and continue visiting us on our blog.
