3 Possible inconveniences that you could present to view JNLP files in Windows
This is because web pages generally do not run JNLP files on the PC without the consent of their administrator. Therefore, below, we will explain everything related to how to open a JNLP file, both in Windows and Mac, thus covering from its definition to its most outstanding aspects.
JNLP means JAVA Network Execution Protocol and is used to run and manage Java programs on a computer or on the internet in general. Files of this type contain information related to the download of the Java program and are saved in XML format.
Remember that currently it is possible to read a JNLP file from a computer with the operating system of Windows or Mac OS. Consequently, this type of application does nothing more than download the code of the program in question to the computer, starting immediately after the first valid instruction for its execution.
Open a file with a JNLP format It is not that difficult to do, it will only be necessary to follow certain instructions. Therefore, below we will explain in a simple and practical way how to open a file with a JNLP extension in Windows.
Therefore, go ahead and open the Internet browser of your choice. If you are on the Internet, use the Url address, but if it is not on the network, look for the location of the file on your PC.
Now within the possibilities that are offered to you choose "Java Web Start”And proceeds to click on the“Accept". In just a few seconds the file with the JNLP extension will be executed successfully.
Sometimes you may not be able to view or use files with the extension JNLP on Windows. Therefore, below we will mention the possible drawbacks, these are:
An update is missing: You will need to make sure that the software is up-to-date, if not, you should check for the most recent version.
The file contains errors: A file with JNLP extension it won't open if it's damaged. If this is the case, try opening other files to verify that it is not a program error.
These are: First, right-click on the JNLP file in question.
Now open the tab "General"Where you must select the button identified as"Change”. Which you can locate in the section of "To open with".
Then using the File Explorer / File Explorer panel Windows go to the folder containing Java executable files
Finally press the button "Accept”In the file's properties screen and try to run it again.
One of the strengths of programs written in Java is their cross-platform nature. These types of applications, in fact, can be run on any operating system that has been previously installed on a Java environment.
Exactly as already seen for Windows, the first thing to do to open JNLP files on Mac computers is to proceed with the installation of the entire Java system.
Once the installation file is obtained, run it on your Mac. Therefore, double-click on the package icon.
Press the "Installation Wizard" button and follow the instructions on the screen to continue.
If everything went in the right direction, the system should display a summary screen on the application you are trying to open.
Possible drawbacks that you could present to view JNLP files on Mac OS
Yes, after trying open a JNLP file By following the instructions mentioned above, you cannot open such a file. In this case, the Java launcher.
At this point, move the top drop-down menu to the option named as “Mac by (Your name)".
Then select the application "Java Web Start”From the list in the right panel. If it cannot be selected, go to settings and select the "All applications" option from the drop-down menu.
