Fortnite is an online action and shooting game, in which you see your character as he performs his movements. It is among the most popular shooter games today.
One of the main reasons is that you can be part of a team of four, who are united by the group motivation to survive. The game consists of completing missions, eliminating enemies and trying to be the last survivor of a group of 96 players that make up different teams.
The save the world mode is paid and is available for consoles and personal computers. To access this modality, you must purchase a Save the World pack through the means provided by the company.
Despite the great acceptance of Fortnite and the number of new users who contact the game daily, other users want unincorporate the application. The reasons can be diverse, but we want to focus on the common procedures that users often use.
For the process of uninstalling Fornite to be carried out correctly, you must carry out the procedure from the Epic Games client. In this way, you will be able to remove all the files and free up the space they occupy.
Open the start menu and in the search bar type the word "Epic Games Launcher" and hit the "Enter" key.
While it opens, it may ask for your Epic Games account password.
Under the Fortnite identification icon you will see three dots, click there to access the options.
Go to the search bar of the start menu and type the word "task" to enter the task manager and press the "Enter" key.
Confirm by clicking on the "End the process tree" bar.
The uninstallation process of the Launcher will start, on the screen you will see the progress of the activity.
Additionally, you will also lose all the games that you activate using that account, so carefully evaluate the reasons and effects of deleting an account in Epic Games. If you still want to delete the Fortnite account you can do it this way:
On the screen you will receive the confirmation that the Epic Games account has been deleted. With this procedure, Fortnite will no longer be available, as well as all the games that you had associated with this account.
