News - Does interactive flat panel have radiation? What harm does it have to the human body?
Does interactive flat panel have radiation? What harm does it have to the human body?
Will it cause harm to human body? In fact, most interactive flat panel shell adopts engineering clinker and sheet metal parts, but the radiation is to achieve environmental protection standard, the radiation value in the range of security, don’t need too care about, generally speaking, the interactive flat panel than a regular desktop computer radiation values will be a little bit big, but don’t worry, it will not bring harm to the body;
Laptop computer radiation is mainly laptop keyboard and display screen, because the top of the keyboard is combining site, screen, keyboard, and the processor of desktop radiation to human body harm the largest is the keyboard and mouse, than the radiation, actually about the same, but the user’s hand often contact is the mouse and keyboard, so the two products to human body harm is the largest.
