What are the benefits of interactive touch panel for enterprise meeting applications?
Interactive touch panel It can not only improve the meeting efficiency of enterprises, but also help enterprises save management costs.
Documents such as PowerPoint can be transmitted to the conference through one click from smart phones, tablets or computers. Wireless screen display equipment, supporting the synchronous transmission of sound map, can realize the bi-directional operation of PC and meeting tablet, as long as the reverse operation of the computer on the conference touch integrated machine, can realize the PPT page turning annotation and other actions, complete the document switching display.
Interactive touch panel can realize remote screen sharing.
Remote desktop sharing enables participants to share information in real time no matter how far they are. This saves time and money and prevents misunderstandings during communication.
