In contrast to the traditional “blackboard learning era”, within 45 minutes of classroom time, the content of the blackboard written by the teacher can only be written and erased, and cannot be preserved for a long time under the dual limitations of blackboard space and alternate teaching of subjects.
In addition, we all know that in the current era, the teaching content of excellent teachers is precious, and it is a teaching resource urgently needed by school teachers and students. The traditional blackboard has the characteristics of writing and erasing, making it impossible to remember and store, let alone widely shared.
* Keep the traditional blackboard/whiteboard writing habits and add new smart board writing technology, all teachers will be fast involved in teaching conditions.
